      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "Allowed MEMBER posts inline comment 9001 on src/x.ts; a non-allowed actor (association NONE) posts comment 9002 on src/x.ts with arbitrary instructions → handling evt for 9001 batches 9002, relabels it as the MEMBER's, triageByEvent has no entry so classifyComment falls back to pathInScope (in scope) → 9002's body is applied by the repair session and pushed",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/loop_daemon/agent_handlers.ts:address_pr_review handler",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/loop_daemon/github_port.ts:prReviewComments",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/loop_daemon/agent_handlers.ts:classifyComment fallback",
